creenshot4.png", "id": "459311616671184", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_459311620004517_7580658906980873012_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u30IOKUpaEQQ7kNvwGoopk2&_nc_oc=AdpObfrkGWnOB8cynWf2rQm7QvBJt8yEDwImX46mlPUDCE7GvKgmcSKkpx2m5PjuDnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2PKOmXpuhGwKaeBF_QtRSBWcVfJFn7VkLYcCalwSanZw&oe=69E22A1C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Game Night", "keywords": ["party", "family", "multiplayer", "MR", "minigame"], "long_description": "# Local Multiplayer Mayhem\nInvite your friends and family to bring their Quest to yours for the ultimate party experience! **Play together** in person with **up to four players**. With **competitive and cooperative** play it suits everyone from teens to grandparents. It'll bring any event to life from birthday parties to team building exercises.\n\n**Online multiplayer is not supported** as everyone's rooms are different sizes and shapes. Plus there\u2019s just no substitute for playing together in person!\n\n\n# Single Player Mastery\nOnly have one headset? No worries, **perfect your skills in single player**. Each minigame has **hidden strategies** to learn. Beat your personal best and give yourself the edge for the next party.\n\n\n# Get Physical\n**Move fast** comfortably and safely (no more standing on the cat or punching the wall)! **Your body is the controller!** Use your hands, head, body and even your voice to interact with the game and your friends. Play hard and feel the burn.\n\n\n# No motion sickness\nIn MR, you\u2019re moving, not the world so your body doesn\u2019t get confused. With the Quest 3, **even the most prone can play** without risk of feeling rough. If they don\u2019t believe you, say I said it\u2019ll be ok.\n\n\n# Join the community\nJoin our discord to share your ideas or to find other players in your community.\nhttps://discord.com/invite/mDWR7yjXy4 \n\n\nAvailable on Quest 3, Quest 3S, Quest Pro, and Quest 2.", "short_description": "Run around your lounge together playing your favorite party games imagined to life around you in Mixed Reality.\n\nMaster minigames solo, or invite friends and family around for the ultimate party! Combining the best that board games and sports have to offer you\u2019ll test your mind and body. With cooperative and competitive play there is something for everyone from teens to grandparents. \n\nJoin us on our Early Access journey. Together we will make Game Night the best MR game on Meta Quest!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.fantailgames.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fantail Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.fantailgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER", "CO_OP"], "id": "8603854549649724"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 13, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1402802851048179"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1965327361079891"}, {"status": "PENDING", "id": "1578902666579364"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1359986312015750"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "730748286738963"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1849302439027441"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "750166094484589"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1997058834456065"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1331747784591438"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3608302112803856"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1182288839918021"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "914957820358023"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1022010503012400"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1022010503012400"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1776445200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1402802851048179"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26402704519338120", "version": "0.5.18"}, "id": "532812109502638", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8603854472983065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26402704519338120"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "532812109502638"}]}, "change_log": "We've been testing the game hard and have a new big bug fix update.\n\nFixes:\n> Fixed issues resolving IP addresses preventing games connecting\n> Fixes network time protocol issues preventing games connecting\n> Fixed issue loading rooms that have little to no floor space\n> Fixed extremely rare issue where the only the ready up button would appear and not the tournament board\n> Other minor fixes and performance improvements", "created_date": 1775692381, "id": "26402704519338120", "version": "0.5.18", "version_code": 158, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8603854472983065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26402704519338120"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1775125885, "id": "26331204989821407", "version": "0.5.17", "version_code": 157, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8603854472983065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26402704519338120"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "532812109502638"}]}, "change_log": "Hot fix: Fixed issue connecting headsets that are on different time locales.\n\nAlso in this update:\n* Fixed soft lock when denying rate game popup\n* Boat is now anchored during the tutorial\n* Enforced minimum water height in fishing game", "created_date": 1774911645, "id": "26303477652594141", "version": "0.5.16", "version_code": 156, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8603854472983065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26402704519338120"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "532812109502638"}]}, "change_log": "Happy Easter everyone. We have a massive bug fix update for you all. We play tested the game with 500 people over the weekend and found a host of previously known issues which we've been smashing.\n\n\nKnown issues:\n\nUnfortunately Meta's App Sharing feature is broken again. If you're attempting to connect a second headset to your game and it is getting a \"Spatial Data\" issue, here is the workaround until they fix it.\n\n1. Turn off App Sharing on all headsets\n2. Load the game from the same profile on all headsets\n3. If this doesn't work, uninstall the game from all profiles and reinstall it on the main profile you want to play from (this is another related Meta OS bug)\n\n\nFixes in this update:\n\nGeneral:\n* Game now requires version 81+ of Horizon OS (we use all the latest features)\n* We've enabled Meta's new Frame Sync feature which improves game smoothness\n* Improvements to game hosting\n* Networking speed improvements\n* General reduction in jitter across games\n* Improved messaging around room loading issues\n* Fixed game assets sometimes not showing\n* Fixed many issues when host is a spectator including game hangs\n* Fixed rare soft lock on game over\n* Fixed rare issue where not all players see everyone's player token and ready button\n* Fixed room alignment breaking after rejoining from 10+ sec in standby\n\nFishing:\n* Fixed score popups sometimes not displaying\n* Fixed score buoy's not responding correctly to player interactions\n\nHockey:\n* Occasionally the hockey puck got stuck on the edge of the room\n* Smoother gameplay when passing the puck between players\n\nTrains:\n* Now showing correct cargo on train\n* Ensure trains look the same size for everyone", "created_date": 1774589732, "id": "26264002809874959", "version": "0.5.15", "version_code": 155, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8603854472983065", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26402704519338120"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1774092833, "id": "26202533729355201", "version": "0.5.14", "version_code": 154, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}